"查無當日新消息;近期暴漲暴跌,公司將更名 Ohmyswift,10/7 申報上限 4,000 萬美元股權購買協議(可隨時賣股籌資)","newsDetail":"> **今日跌因:** 公司當日沒有新消息，股價在近期暴漲後回落；11/12 收 **$5.06**，11/13 盤前報 **$4.55**，跌約 **10%**。\n\nOhmyhome 股東 10/26 臨時股東會通過更名與遷冊案，公司 11/9 申報確認已完成從開曼群島遷冊至英屬維京群島，法定名稱改為 **Ohmyswift Limited**，股票代號仍為 OMH，並在申請新的證券識別碼。公司原本是新加坡的房地產科技與仲介服務商，6 月以 **1 美元**將主要營運子公司出售。\n\n籌資方面，公司 10/7 申報公開說明書補充文件，與 Magnus Capital Ventures 簽訂備用股權購買協議，可在 **24 個月**內視需要出售最多 **$4,000 萬**的 A 類普通股，每股最低價 $0.10，收購價為 $1.26 或前 180 個交易日最低收盤價的一半（取低者）。文件顯示發行前 A 類流通股約 **191 萬股**，公司 8/31 已完成 50 股合 1 股的反向分割。\n\n公司另須在 **2027 年 1 月 11 日**前讓股價重回 $1 以上，以符合那斯達克最低股價規定。","newsLinks":[{"label":"Finviz","url":"https://finviz.com/quote.ashx?t=OMH"},{"label":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/OMH"},{"label":"TradingView News","url":"https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/NASDAQ-OMH/news/"}],"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T07:00:00-05:00","publishedTimezone":"ET","sources":[{"label":"Stock Titan OMH 概覽","url":"https://www.stocktitan.net/overview/OMH/"},{"label":"424B5 摘要（Stock Titan）","url":"https://www.stocktitan.net/sec-filings/OMH/424b5-ohmyhome-ltd-prospectus-supplement-debt-securities-103a0fcd7782.html"}],"sessions":[{"last":4.57,"chgPct":-8.6,"volume":625925,"session":"post","direction":"down","name":"Ohmyhome Limited","sessionDate":"2026-11-13","targetDate":"2026-11-16"}],"primarySession":"post","primaryDirection":"down","last":4.57,"chgPct":-8.6,"volume":625925,"tv":{"latestEPS":-6.88,"consensusEPS":-64.27,"priorYrEPS":null,"surpriseEPS_pct":89.3,"surpriseEPS_dollar":57.38999999999999,"latestRev_M":8.32,"consensusRev_M":7.92,"priorYrRev_M":null,"surpriseRev_pct":4.99,"yrYrRev_pct":null,"epsYoY_pct":null,"epsEst_next4":[-5.8,-4.64,null,null],"revEst_next4":[10.7,13.16,null,null],"yoyBlock":"N/M / N/M\n--------------------\nN/M / N/M\nN/M / N/M","chart":{"quarters":[],"eps_reported":[-95.46,-6.88,null,null],"eps_estimate":[-89.28,-64.27,-5.8,-4.64],"rev_reported_M":[3.67,8.32,null,null],"rev_estimate_M":[3.73,7.92,10.7,13.16],"latest_idx